    "summary": "This unit may activate the orb as any phase ends, once in the battle. Pick one friendly **NECRONS INFANTRY** or **NECRONS MOUNTED** unit at most 6″ away. That unit **resurrects** under [Reanimation Protocols](vsdata:ability/necrons.reanimation-protocols), healing D6 wounds rather than its usual D3. Your army can resurrect at most one unit each turn.",
